#
# The private NPU kernels the release builds into the NPU lane (docs/npu.md; docs/releases.md).
# The kernels are private: their source is not part of this repository and is never published with
# the release. They ship only as compiled, encrypted artifacts that `1bit` verifies and decrypts
# in memory at load. scripts/fetch-private.sh checks out exactly this commit of this repository
# (with the release machine's GitHub credentials); the build passes the checkout as
# ONEBIT_NPU_PRIVATE, and the release stops if it cannot be fetched.
#
# Move the pin by hand, after the NPU check on Strix Halo (docs/npu.md, "Checking the NPU").
repo=1bit-MONSTER/npu-kernels
sha=aa8433b395cd32714b4c0a824dcccedee7391bba
path=addons
require=CMakeLists.txt register.cpp npu-dx kcrypt
